OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors urged to take part in
OL,4,AOwlman exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition has been inspired by
OL,7,Fan enduring piece of folklore.
OL,9,FMyths of the Owl Creature is a digital
OL,10,Fexhibition at Falmouth Art Gallery
OL,11,Fbased on the Owlman of Mawnan, a
OL,12,Flegendary half man, half bird creature
OL,13,Freported to have been seen flying in
OL,14,Fthe village's woods and churchyard.
OL,16,FArtists Tom Milnes, Jess Pemberton and
OL,17,Fmusician Seamouse are set to continue
OL,18,Fto develop the interactive installation
OL,19,Fthroughout its three-week run, with
OL,20,Fexhibition attendees invited to join in
OL,21,Fthe creative process.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
