OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors urged to take part in
OL,4,AOwlman exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonna Westlake, of Falmouth Art
OL,7,FGallery, said: "Participation is at the
OL,8,Fheart of this project: visitors aren't
OL,9,Fsimply observing the work, they're
OL,10,Fhelping to make it."
